        <div>Explore our featured custom pergola, patio cover, and outdoor living projects across Miami-Dade, Broward, and Palm Beach County—engineered to meet Florida building codes and built for luxury, durability, and coastal performance.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="body-page">
    <div class="project-page">
